<font size="2">Bluestone Promotions is a professional, client-driven, dynamic and creative production company. Ever since we were founded in 2005, we have gained valuable experience in a variety of production fields including: Rock concerts and festivals, private events, business productions and cocktail evenings, product launching, conferences &amp; exhibitions, sales promotion and marketing events.Our internal creative department consolidates the creative concepts of each production based on the strict guidelines of the brand's characteristics and the target audience.We believe that each production is a complex yet complete process that starts with a comprehensive understanding of the brief, from the composition of the concept and theme, to the technical production and management of the event.</font>
